<p>Russian President Vladimir Putin announced a 32-hour ceasefire in the war in Ukraine for Orthodox Easter, with the Kremlin saying Russian forces should halt combat from 4 p.m. Moscow time on Saturday, April 11, until the end of Sunday, April 12. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky said Kyiv would respond &quot;accordingly,&quot; and several outlets said Ukraine would observe the holiday pause. The announcement creates a brief chance for fighting to ease in a war now in its fourth year. But officials and outside observers are treating it as a limited test, not a sign of any broader breakthrough.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/NeXmET_aPZCapgux_I0cleFLg9UPfybU9WYHrzuSZPxTx4zo2mAQ9f2BL4znjYlpEMNF38in13xx0InqSA4Y7v9dKSOdO-0PLMar4fhfBIXqGKe4JNOcCeps3P9bE1m5_nJKAAmQETNPAiYJSXrktDbOQOAZvQLJrsOcVZpqkHRfUCPXpqFZYJDqzsy6EYNlMtajzbboO2wmS9QieXyRQDP6zwn_7758vxjCaD2ZoU2Bbsy0v-mRk6AmE5MELh5Ht4ZPOMs1HS9NSm3scA' alt='In this photo provided by Ukraine&#x27;s 65th Mechanized Brigade press service, recruits practice military skills at a training ground near the frontline in the Zaporizhzhia region, Ukraine, Wednesday, April 8, 2026. (Andriy Andriyenko/Ukraine&#x27;s 65th Mechanized Brigade via AP)' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Military caveat: Even as it ordered the pause, the Kremlin said Russian forces must stay ready to respond to any Ukrainian attacks or provocations during the ceasefire period.</li><li>Scope of order: Le Monde reported that Putin told the Russian General Staff to &quot;cease combat operations in all directions&quot; for the Easter period, presenting the pause as a battlefield-wide order rather than a local arrangement.</li><li>Stated rationale: Meduza said Putin described the ceasefire as being ordered &quot;based on humanitarian considerations,&quot; underscoring Moscow&#x27;s effort to present the pause as more than a tactical move.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Kremlin: Moscow presented the Easter pause as a unilateral Russian move and said it expected Ukraine to follow suit, rather than describing it as the result of a negotiated bilateral deal. (<a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/09/putin-declares-easter-ceasefire-in-ukraine'>Meduza</a>)</li><li>Ukrainian government: Several outlets said Zelensky had already proposed a temporary Easter truce earlier in the week, including through the United States, allowing Kyiv to cast its response as support for an idea it had already put forward. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/russias-putin-announces-orthodox-easter-ceasefire-expects-ukraine-to-do-the-same'>The Straits Times</a>, <a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/putin-declares-weekend-ceasefire-in-russias-war-against-ukraine-for-orthodox-easter'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li><li>Western media assessment: The New York Times highlighted why Kyiv remained wary, noting that last year&#x27;s Easter pause ended with both sides accusing each other of violations. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/09/world/europe/russia-ukraine-cease-fire.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>RFE/RL analysis: RFE/RL said the ceasefire came as negotiations involving Russia, Ukraine, and the United States had stalled while Washington focused on its own war with Iran. (<a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/ukraine-russia-orthdox-easter-ceasefire-zelenskyy-putin/33728799.html'>Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/09/world/europe/russia-ukraine-cease-fire.html'>Putin Announces Orthodox Easter Cease-Fire, but Ukraine Is Skeptical</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/putin-declares-ceasefire-in-ukraine-for-orthodox-easter/article70844673.ece'>Putin declares ceasefire in Ukraine for Orthodox Easter</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/russias-putin-announces-orthodox-easter-ceasefire-expects-ukraine-to-do-the-same'>Russia’s Putin announces Orthodox Easter ceasefire, Ukraine’s Zelensky agrees</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/09/vladimir-putin-announces-orthodox-easter-ceasefire-in-ukraine-war_6752271_4.html'>Russia and Ukraine agree to Orthodox Easter ceasefire</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/ukraine-russia-orthdox-easter-ceasefire-zelenskyy-putin/33728799.html'>Ukraine, Russia Agree To 32-Hour Truce For Orthodox Easter</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/09/russias-president-announces-orthodox-easter-ceasefire-with-ukraine-kremlin-says'>Russia&#x27;s president announces Orthodox Easter ceasefire with Ukraine, Kremlin says</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-russia-s-putin-declares-easter-ceasefire/a-76728827'>Ukraine: Russia&#x27;s Putin declares Easter ceasefire</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn0wkkwev2vo'>Russia and Ukraine agree to truce for Orthodox Easter</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/637881-putin-easter-ceasefire-ukraine/'>Putin announces Easter ceasefire</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://meduza.io/en/news/2026/04/09/putin-declares-easter-ceasefire-in-ukraine'>Putin orders Easter ceasefire, calls on Ukraine to follow</a> - meduza.io</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/putin-declares-weekend-ceasefire-in-russias-war-against-ukraine-for-orthodox-easter'>Putin declares weekend ceasefire in Russia&#x27;s war against Ukraine for Orthodox Easter</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-ukraine-russia-easter-ceasefire-putin-zelensky/'>Putin and Zelensky agree to Orthodox Easter ceasefire</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-putin-ceasefire-ukraine-orthodox-easter/'>Putin declares 32-hour ceasefire in Ukraine for Orthodox Easter</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/09/vladimir-putin-announces-orthodox-easter-ceasefire-with-ukraine'>Vladimir Putin announces Orthodox Easter ceasefire with Ukraine</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://en.interfax.com.ua/news/general/1158030.html'>Russian president Vladimir Putin declares a ceasefire for the weekend in Ukraine for Orthodox Easter.</a> - interfax.com.ua</li></ul>